שגוי.</b> זהו המקדם מסעיף א׳. כדי לקבל את הנגזרת צריך לכפול אותו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:3}}!\\cdot{{CT:4}}!\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "wtot", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> כופלים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(m!\\,n!={{CT:3}}!\\cdot{{CT:4}}!\\)</span>, ולא ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\((m+n)!\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> המקדם של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(x^my^n\\)</span> בטור טיילור סביב הראשית הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\frac{1}{m!\\,n!}\\cdot\\frac{\\partial^{m+n}f}{\\partial x^m\\partial y^n}(0,0)\\)</span>. חלצו מכאן את הנגזרת.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a", "ak", "ck", "coef", "f", "facs", "g1", "g2", "g3", "g4", "g5", "gi", "gk", "k", "mono", "mx", "ny", "p", "pq", "q", "tans1", "tans2", "uu", "wtot"], "nvariants": 50}